  "description": "We're in our light and bright era so only a salad will do! These garlic and herb chickpeas are super hearty and are the star of this dish. When paired with a veggie-loaded couscous salad and with some stellar harissa hummus and pepitas, this ensemble presents a dish for the ages! This recipe is under 650kcal per serving. We’ve replaced the paprika spice blend in this recipe with garlic & herb seasoning due to local ingredient availability. It’ll be just as delicious, just follow your recipe card!",
