  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. To a medium bowl, add couscous and the salt.\n• Add the boiling water (3/4 cup for 2 people / 11/2 cups for 4 people) and stir to combine. Immediately cover with a plate and leave for 5 minutes.\n• Fluff up with fork and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67281b09d32d2a49ba7d8d5d-4c5d3fc3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice lemon into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine hummus, harissa paste and a splash of water. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67281b09d32d2a49ba7d8d5d-45d93aaa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas, stirring, until slightly tender, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add the butter, garlic & herb seasoning and garlic, then cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• In a large bowl, combine a good squeeze of lemon juice, a good drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• To the dressing, add couscous, cucumber, tomatoes and rocket leaves. Toss to combine and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67281b09d32d2a49ba7d8d5d-68440626.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide couscous salad between bowls then top with herby chickpeas.\n• Dollop over harissa hummus and garnish with pepitas.\n• Serve with remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67281b09d32d2a49ba7d8d5d-d29b06d3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
